Nicolas Brouard and Wayne Sullivan for the 1990 French PC
distribution. As for the Czech/Slovakian contribution it is
Accents, a utility by Jiri Zlatuska, Brno, (with posted binary
for PC) for deriving virtual fonts from fonts of CM or Adobe
standard encoding.

