See ftp  ftp.univ-rennes1.fr. Also, ftp matups.matups
/pub/TeX/Fonts.dir/DM.dir for a good deal more on the DM fonts.
Note that the DM's have there just become available in Textures
Macintosh format.

For Accents, see ftp matups.matups
 /pub/TeX/Metafont.dir/Accents.dir

The DM fonts and Zlatushka's are downward compatible with the
huge population of CM fonts, provided one uses suitable accent
administration macros (Caesar macros). format-dumper takes care
of that: see /pub/TeX/format-dumper-cm.dir.  (No hassle
then with math, the upright Greek caps are all there.)

